{"title":"Ogre Charger","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 42 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 29 times (2.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=41\">Lv 41 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>41</b></td><td>203</td><td>27.1</td><td>2,050</td><td class=\"muted\">609 · 37.9 · 6,150</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Cove\">Ogre Cove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre-charger\" data-map-level=\"41\">Show level 41 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9fd67203bd9e3477061b.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e6753b64a9745838cd85.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 25–44 · Werewolfpelt armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/9fd67203bd9e3477061b.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 2 looted corpses, 59 recorded drops, 2,698 total, 16–229 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-835.4px,-249.4px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:0px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:0px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/4/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:256px\"><i style=\"left:688.2px;top:244.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:902.0px;top:315.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:932.4px;top:224.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:902.0px;top:277.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:910.3px;top:245.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:801.8px;top:282.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:765.3px;top:251.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:879.0px;top:301.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:787.6px;top:284.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:902.0px;top:251.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:831.0px;top:234.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:927.7px;top:241.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:924.6px;top:274.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:916.2px;top:194.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:929.0px;top:283.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:889.1px;top:205.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:909.4px;top:306.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:836.3px;top:278.4px